  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MyJustice Phase III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The programme&apos;s overall objective is to contribute to a more peaceful and prosperous Myanmar. This will be achieved through the following specific objectives:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: windowtext;&quot;&gt;To promote more inclusive and cohesive communities through a strengthened, more resilient civil society network that defends and promotes fundamental rights. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: windowtext;&quot;&gt;To strengthen community justice mechanisms to be more inclusive, equitable, sustainable and protect fundamental rights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: windowtext;&quot;&gt;The programme is designed around three mutually reinforcing result areas as detailed below: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: windowtext;&quot;&gt;Legal Empowerment and Youth-Focused Awareness Raising: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: windowtext;&quot;&gt;Youth and the public at large are empowered with the legal information, knowledge, and skills to combat injustice and build more cohesive communities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: windowtext;&quot;&gt;Legal Aid Services:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: windowtext;&quot;&gt; the human rights needs of vulnerable communities are addressed through the provision of holistic and higher quality holistic legal aid services. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: windowtext;&quot;&gt;Community-Justice: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: windowtext;&quot;&gt;community justice mechanisms and emerging non-state justice systems are strengthened to effectively deliver people-centred justice across Myanmar&#xbf;s diverse justice landscape, fostering stronger dispute resolution and a more cohesive society in which trust and reconciliation can thrive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
